{"duration_api_ms":98134,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"f4835ecb-30fa-42e6-bfe0-82699122bb45","total_cost_usd":0.173014,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16655,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":10639,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":6085},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16655,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":10639,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16655,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16655},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":10639,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":16655,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.173014,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":6085,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"The front is a single one-parameter curve. Every non-dominated point sits at D~3.385, b=1.2, cone=70 and differs only in flight-path angle. Flux runs from 227k W/m2 at gamma=-1.5 to 274.5k at -3.5702, while bondline T falls from 417.9 K to 391.1 K. Each of the other three variables is pinned by a wall: D by the mass fraction (margin ~3e-5), b and cone by the surrogate hull (b=1.202 and cone 69 both fail), and gamma by max_g=12 (about 1.7 g/deg). Other geometries such as C-ea6fa32467e5 (b 0.9, cone 66) are dominated. Only 21 evaluations remain, so I fill the gaps in the gamma sweep at fixed geometry. This should trim the staircase area under the front with almost no risk of geometry failure.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-b8e5f12114a1 (gamma -1.5) and C-a21e478c2d2d (gamma -3.5702, max_g margin 1.2e-5) are the two ends of the feasible front; all 12 listed non-dominated points share D=3.385, b=1.2, cone=70.\",\"Flux and T are smooth and nearly linear in gamma between neighbours, e.g. C-255298c956e9 (-2.58: 250860, 402.02) and C-74cfdfd96a8c (-2.78: 255600, 399.55). Linear interpolation should therefore be accurate.\",\"Hull and geometry failures at b=1.202-1.208 (C-507815483127 etc.), cone 69 (C-d0f9b054a40c) and cone 62-64 (C-17a9b770e63c) show that b, cone and D cannot be pushed further.\",\"C-ea6fa32467e5 (b 0.9, cone 66, gamma -3.5) gives 294k W/m2 and 394.6 K, dominated by C-8d69d1842e32 (272.9k, 391.76 K). Lower b or cone gives no gain.\",\"Peak g of 11.88 at -3.5 and 12.0 at -3.5702 (C-a21e478c2d2d) confirm gamma is capped near -3.5702.\"],\"mechanism\":\"This relies on the data plus prior Sutton-Graves reasoning. Peak flux falls with nose radius b*D and with ballistic coefficient, so the largest D that meets the mass fraction, with maximal b and cone, is best. Steeper entry shortens the heating pulse, which lowers bondline T at the cost of higher peak flux and g. Peak g is nearly independent of D and depends on gamma. The trade-off is therefore traced only by gamma at the box corner, and the remaining gain is from denser sampling of that curve, especially the g-limited end.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The predictions are interpolations between measured neighbours. The main risks are the max_g margin at gamma about -3.565 to -3.5703, which is under 1e-4 g from the limit, and the mass margin, which is untouched because D is not changed. The hypervolume gain from these points is expected to be very small (~1e-4 or less).\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-93785304c358\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.5 and -1.55 at the low-flux end.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.52},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":227584,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.54,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front at the low-flux end.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-93785304c358\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.55 and -1.6.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":228760,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":416.55,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-ae2f39f03bd5\",\"rationale\":\"Midpoint between gamma -1.6 and -1.7.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.65},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":230170,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":415.41,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-185722c627b2\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.7 and -1.83.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.77},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":232640,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":413.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-975c00593c66\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.87 and -1.95.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.9},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":235440,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":411.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-760c0b324dc5\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.95 and -2.1.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.02},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":238030,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":409.69,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-1127467d0751\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.15 and -2.31.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.22},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":242510,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":406.82,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f486233314de\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.37 and -2.58.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.45},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":247815,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":403.71,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-255298c956e9\",\"rationale\":\"A second point in the wide -2.37 to -2.58 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":248986,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":403.06,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-255298c956e9\",\"rationale\":\"Midpoint between gamma -2.58 and -2.78.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.68},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":253230,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":400.79,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-74cfdfd96a8c\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.78 and -2.95.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.87},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":257740,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":398.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies